# Installed to /etc/cron.d/announce-ip by music-screen-api/pi-setup/setup.sh.
# Every minute, broadcast "192.168.68.61 is this Pi" (a gratuitous ARP) on Wi-Fi.
# Why: on 2026-11-16 the Pi was healthy (internet, router and Sonos all fine) but
# no other device could reach it until it was power-cycled. The suspected cause
# is the Deco mesh or other devices losing track of the Pi's address. This keeps
# them current. Harmless; delete this file to undo. Needs iputils-arping.
* * * * * root /usr/bin/arping -U -c 1 -I wlan0 192.168.68.61 >/dev/null 2>&1
